# This is an ALLOWLIST and must not be loosened: the Dockerfile uses
# `COPY . .` and the repo root may hold a .env with secrets.
#
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the build needs.
# This keeps .env (secrets), .git, the local ./atdevice-api binary, docs,
# deploy/ and installer/ out of the build context.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/

# Embedded migrations (internal/migrate/migrations/*.sql) are covered by
# !internal/ and are required by go:embed.

# Not needed to build the binary.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata

# Never include, even if re-included by a rule above.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
atdevice-api
